      "text": "Figure F1 (experiments E1, E2, E4 and E5; v3 identifiers H2a, H2b and H3c). One panel per primary part, one row per system. Each marker is the stored estimate and each bar its moving-block bootstrap percentile interval (blocks of 5 consecutive test states, 2000 resamples) at level 98.33%. The shaded region is the pass band of v3 §2. Marker shape and text give the stored verdict: filled circle pass, cross fail, open diamond inconclusive. A system that failed the validation gate is marked PROVISIONAL.",
